  "use_case": "Use this catering order time-ordered tracking when staff must document menu line and guarantee date. Reconcile production count, delivery, dietary instruction, and client signoff before the catering order handoff. Use the signed order, menu-line worksheet, guarantee confirmation, kitchen production count, delivery ticket, dietary flag, service-equipment list, and receiving signature. Ask the assigned catering order reviewer to confirm menu line against the organization's policy.",
